    <!-- ================= HAPPY CUSTOMERS ================= -->
    <section class="bg-brand-50/60 py-10 lg:py-14">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5">
        <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="reveal relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ink-900 to-ink-700 p-7 text-white lg:row-span-1">
            <div class="absolute -right-12 -top-12 -z-10 h-44 w-44 rounded-full bg-brand-500/30 blur-2xl"></div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Our Happy Customers</h2>
            <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
              <p class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check mt-0.5 text-brand-400"></i>Reviews, Certified for travel excellence</p>
              <p class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check mt-0.5 text-brand-400"></i>Thousands of Happy Travelers, endless unforgettable memories</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 border-t border-white/15 pt-5">
              <img src="~/NewUI/assets/img/trustpilot.png" alt="Trustpilot, 5 stars" loading="lazy" class="h-12 w-auto rounded">
              <img src="~/NewUI/assets/img/pci.png" alt="PCI Security Standards Council" loading="lazy" class="h-12 w-auto">
            </div>
          </div>

          <blockquote class="reveal flex flex-col rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-card ring-1 ring-slate-200/70" data-delay="80">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left text-3xl text-brand-300"></i>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">I had the pleasure of speaking with Leo during a stressful time while needing to change flights due to an emergency, and he assisted me with grace. His empathy and compassion helped make things seem easier for me. He took the time that was needed to ensure all things were done in a timely manner since this was a matter of urgency. Thank you Leo for doing an amazing job and getting us what was needed.</p>
            <footer class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 pt-6">
              <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-900 text-sm font-bold text-white">NR</span>
              <div><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-900">Norma Rodriguez</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Mexico</p></div>
              <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-amber-400" aria-label="5 stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></span>
            </footer>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="reveal flex flex-col rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-card ring-1 ring-slate-200/70" data-delay="160">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left text-3xl text-brand-300"></i>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Sr. Martin Sánchez me ayudó con gusto y atención para reservar asientos y realizar check in para volar por Avianca Airlines. Muy atento y claro dando la información correcta. Le agradezco su amable atención quedando muy satisfecha por su buen servicio. Bendiciones….</p>
            <footer class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 pt-6">
              <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-500 text-sm font-bold text-white">AB</span>
              <div><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-900">Ada Berrios</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">US</p></div>
              <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-amber-400" aria-label="5 stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></span>
            </footer>
          </blockquote>
          <!-- Add more reviews by copying a <blockquote> card. Milena Pardo (Guatemala) was cut off in the design, so her text still needs to be added. -->
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= WHAT WE OFFER ================= -->
