            <div><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-ink-900"><i class="fa-solid fa-tags text-brand-500"></i>Great Deals</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Get great flight deals with excellent customer support — you can call us anytime for help, even at the airport.</p></div>
