            <div><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-ink-900"><i class="fa-solid fa-language text-brand-500"></i>Multilingual Support</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Get assistance in multiple languages for a smooth and convenient booking experience.</p></div>
          </li>
          <li class="reveal flex gap-4 border-t-2 border-slate-200 pt-5 transition hover:border-brand-500" data-delay="240">
            <span class="text-3xl font-black leading-none text-brand-200">04</span>
            <div><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-ink-900"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset text-brand-500"></i>24 Hour Assistance</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Get 24/7 human support in English, Spanish, and Portuguese anytime you need assistance.</p></div>
          </li>
